			"notes": "Gravity v3.0 updates the in-game settings screen with a compact, minimal futuristic layout while preserving all existing controls.\n\n- The interface scales with the game window, targets about half of the viewport diagonal, and fits smaller windows.\n- Current settings are retained when Minecraft relayouts the screen after resizing.\n- Gravity slider, automatic mode, initial value, interval, direction, and /gravity check remain available.\n- The vanilla baseline is clarified: 50% gravity equals 1.0x vanilla gravity.\n\nBuilt for Minecraft 1.21.11 with Fabric."
		},
